{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29833","headline":"奉同诸公题河中任中丞新创河亭四韵之作 · 李商隐","name":"奉同诸公题河中任中丞新创河亭四韵之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万里谁能访十洲，新亭云构压中流。\n河鲛纵翫难爲室，海蜃遥惊耻化楼。\n左右名山穷远目，东西大道锁轻舟。\n独留巧思传千古，长与蒲津作胜游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29833.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29833","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}